comment.narrative:
Target achieved and exceeded. An additional 50 new pre-school teachers have been recruited and are being trained for the&nbsp;start of&nbsp;2024-25 school year.

&nbsp;

&nbsp;

Indicator achieved. GOSE has been extended to middle and high school students since the last mission. In addition, the information system is now able to manage absences (among other things, it can automatically send SMS messages to parents of absent pupils). A module to record&nbsp;pupils&#39; results (creation of report cards after class councils) and a&nbsp;school infrastructure module i currently under development. In the future, it is planned that the platform will include private schools and schools for EABS, that it will be open to parents, that it will become the basis for the statistical yearbook, and that it will enable certain analyses (e.g. on the impact of pre-school on learning).&nbsp;

&nbsp;

&nbsp;

&nbsp;
